      "versionNonce": 87849763,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1770819519866,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "检测环境支持的cpu特性并复制优化实现\nclaude实现示例：\nvoid\nNeonVectorInit(void)\n{\n#ifdef HAS_SVE\n    if (SupportsSve())\n    {\n        SveVectorInit();\n        return;\n    }\n#endif\n    \n#ifdef HAS_NEON\n    VectorL2SquaredDistanceNeonPtr = VectorL2SquaredDistanceNeon;\n    VectorInnerProductNeonPtr = VectorInnerProductNeon;\n    /* ... */\n#endif\n}",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "检测环境支持的cpu特性并复制优化实现\nclaude实现示例：\nvoid\nNeonVectorInit(void)\n{\n#ifdef HAS_SVE\n    if (SupportsSve())\n    {\n        SveVectorInit();\n        return;\n    }\n#endif\n    \n#ifdef HAS_NEON\n    VectorL2SquaredDistanceNeonPtr = VectorL2SquaredDistanceNeon;\n    VectorInnerProductNeonPtr = VectorInnerProductNeon;\n    /* ... */\n#endif\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
